From 4b8d0a64c638829b01f09f05f98f702c097b68a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:56:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ADD strict selected-agent slash routing so backend
 commands do not become prompts

Selected-agent messages that begin with a slash command use the provider command path instead of normal prompt send. This lets backend commands run against the existing agent session immediately while ordinary task prompts keep the existing send and queue behavior.
